<h1>Admonitions</h1>
<p>Default note:</p>
<aside class="aside aside-note" aria-label="Note">
<p class="aside-title">Note</p>
<section class="aside-content">
<p>Plain note body with <code>code</code> and <strong>bold</strong>.</p>
</section>
</aside>
<p>Tip:</p>
<aside class="aside aside-tip" aria-label="Quick tip">
<p class="aside-title">Quick tip</p>
<section class="aside-content">
